[0.036, "o", " ◆ \u001b[32marchiveweb.page\u001b[0m : A High-Fidelity Web Archiving Extension for Chrome and Chromium based browsers.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mbrave-beta\u001b[0m : Unofficial, a privacy oriented Web Browser based on Chromium, this is the \"beta\" release.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mbrave-nightly\u001b[0m : Unofficial, a privacy oriented Web Browser based on Chromium, this is the \"nightly\" release.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mbrave\u001b[0m : Unofficial, a privacy oriented Web Browser based on Chromium, this is the \"stable\" release.\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", " ◆ \u001b[32mchromium-beta\u001b[0m : Unofficial. FOSS Web Browser, base of Google Chrome, beta edition.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mchromium-bsu\u001b[0m : Unofficial. Fast paced arcade style scrolling space shooter, game.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mchromium-edge\u001b[0m : Unofficial. FOSS Web Browser, base of Google Chrome, edge edition.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mchromium-rc\u001b[0m : Unofficial. FOSS Web Browser, base of Google Chrome, release candidate.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mchromium\u001b[0m : Unofficial. FOSS Web Browser, base of Google Chrome, Edge and Brave, stable.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mgo2tv\u001b[0m : Cast media files to Smart TVs and Chromecast devices.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mgoogle-chrome-beta\u001b[0m : Unofficial, Web Browser, Beta version.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mgoogle-chrome-dev\u001b[0m : Unofficial, Web Browser, Unstable version.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mgoogle-chrome\u001b[0m : Unofficial, Web Browser, Stable version.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mhelium\u001b[0m : The Chromium-based web browser made for people, with love. Best privacy by default, unbiased ad-blocking, no bloat and no noise.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mthorium\u001b[0m : Web Browser, a Chromium fork including Widevine and FFmpeg support.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mungoogled-chromium\u001b[0m : Chromium Web Browser without Google services.\r\n ◆ \u001b[32mvaria\u001b[0m : Unofficial. Aria2-based advanced download manager with support for downloading files, torrents, video and audio + support for Chromium and \r\n   Firefox extension.\r\n"]
